ir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.DH6\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for DH6 </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#diet-daily-or-more (&quot;Täglich oder mehrmals täglich&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#diet-4-6-per-week (&quot;4 bis 6 Mal pro Woche&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#diet-1-3-per-week (&quot;1 bis 3 Mal pro Woche&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#diet-less-than-once-per-week (&quot;Weniger als einmal pro Woche&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#diet-never (&quot;Nie&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#meta-unknown (&quot;Weiß nicht&quot;)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers#meta-not-stated (&quot;Keine Angabe&quot;)</li></ul></div>"
